# _redirects - single source of truth for BFC routing AND sitemap metadata.
#
# Clean-URL rewrites (status 200). The inline comment after each 200 rule feeds
# the discovery-file generator (sitemap.xml / sitemap.html / robots.txt / llms.txt):
#
#     /path   /path.html   200   # Category | Label | optional note for llms.txt
#
# Netlify ignores everything from '#' onward, so these comments are safe.
# Rules:
#   - "Category | Label"  -> nice label, filed under that category heading.
#   - third " | note"      -> extra sentence used only in llms.txt (optional).
#   - "# exclude"          -> live route, but kept OUT of all discovery files
#                             (e.g. the sitemap page itself).
#   - no comment           -> label derived from the URL, filed under "Other".
# Category display order is set in scripts/generate-sitemaps.js (CATEGORY_ORDER).

